WEBVTT

1
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:33,080
Why did you come to the front again?

2
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:56,870
stroke again

3
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:58,710
It's direction and focus

4
00:00:58,710 --> 00:00:59,790
Then why didn't you tell me just now?

5
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:01,070
you did not agree to the exchange

6
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,300
Still want my twenty years

7
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,500
You came back on your own

8
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,540
And I can give it to you here

9
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:15,970
So do I have a choice? What can I take?

10
00:01:15,970 --> 00:01:17,450
What's in this box

11
00:01:17,690 --> 00:01:18,890
Can you go out after taking your things?

12
00:01:18,970 --> 00:01:20,010
You won't go around in circles, right?

13
00:01:20,010 --> 00:01:21,010
take them

14
00:01:21,170 --> 00:01:22,690
you can go somewhere else

15
00:01:23,170 --> 00:01:26,550
But how long did it take for it to change back?

16
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:29,960
Twenty years, twenty years

17
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:33,110
You agree to the exchange and I agree.

18
00:01:33,190 --> 00:03:42,460
This year will be twenty years, there are so many islands, which one should I choose? Which gentleman should I choose?

19
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,460
You look miserable

20
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:44,460
Need help?

21
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:46,210
I don't want anything

22
00:03:46,210 --> 00:03:51,090
I won't give you my life anymore. We don't want to give you anything. Just stay away from me.

23
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:53,080
If you need help, call us

24
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:58,700
Are you hungry? Eat

25
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:00,460
I'll stay away. I won't change anything.

26
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:03,540
It's the uncle who feeds you

27
00:04:03,540 --> 00:04:04,580
Remember to eat well

28
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:17,740
Dad, I brought you chopsticks

29
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:23,000
Wake up sir sir

30
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,400
We saw you passed out in the street

31
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,600
I brought you back to rest

32
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,600
who are you

33
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,920
What the hell is this place?

34
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,400
Tell me now what exactly do you want to take from me?

35
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,400
I really beg you

36
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,400
Stop torturing me

37
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,840
We are just ordinary people

38
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,240
This is called the place of imagination

39
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,400
You can do whatever you want here, no one will want anything from you

40
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,320
take anything

41
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,640
Then how can I get out? I want to go to the other side.

42
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,720
tell me how to get out

43
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,680
people who come to us

44
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,720
no one wants to go out

45
00:04:45,890 --> 00:04:47,730
What do you mean no one wants to go out?

46
00:04:47,730 --> 00:04:48,930
I'll take you to a fun place

47
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:46,660
Why do you look exactly like me?

48
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:48,020
There are so many people who look the same

49
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:51,900
So what are you doing in front of me? Can't you see I'm walking? Aren't you tired from walking like this?

50
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,100
You'll get used to it after walking for a long time

51
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:55,300
I've been gone for five or six hundred years

52
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:56,980
You've been here for so long, right?

53
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:59,180
I don’t remember exactly how long it took to be happier.

54
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:00,340
time flies faster

55
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:01,700
The more boring you are, the slower time passes

56
00:07:03,770 --> 00:07:04,930
If there's nothing else, I'll leave first

57
00:07:05,890 --> 00:07:26,180
where are you from

58
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,700
Uncle, why did you beat me if you didn't steal?

59
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:29,460
Are you unhappy? No

60
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:30,500
Uncle is thinking about something

61
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:32,260
Uncle, you just have something on your mind

62
00:07:32,260 --> 00:07:33,340
Close your eyes like this

63
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:34,980
I'll take you to play in the sea

64
00:07:34,980 --> 00:07:38,180
Close your eyes quickly

65
00:07:38,180 --> 00:07:39,890
Are you ready, uncle?

66
00:07:39,890 --> 00:07:42,010
We're going to the sea. I'm ready.

67
00:07:42,010 --> 00:07:43,410
Open your eyes, uncle.

68
00:07:43,410 --> 00:07:51,380
No, you can breathe in here

69
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:54,110
Let's go, uncle

70
00:07:54,110 --> 00:08:38,150
Let's play uncle

71
00:08:38,150 --> 00:08:39,550
This is the place of imagination

72
00:08:39,550 --> 00:08:43,270
You can do whatever you want. How old are you?

73
00:08:43,270 --> 00:08:44,460
He's six years old, right?

74
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:46,060
Uncle, why are you asking this?

75
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:47,020
I'm just curious

76
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:48,220
I'm one hundred and sixteen years old

77
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:53,730
Uncle, what are you looking for? You're not looking for anything.

78
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:55,210
Are you looking for this? Here it is

79
00:08:55,210 --> 00:08:56,330
When you first came here

80
00:08:56,330 --> 00:08:57,290
He fell into the swimming pool

81
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:59,470
I put it away for you

82
00:08:59,470 --> 00:09:02,750
Sir, how are you feeling today?

83
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:04,270
It seems to me that you still have something on your mind that you haven't let go of.

84
00:09:04,270 --> 00:09:06,830
Anything you want to do here can come true. Just tell me, uncle.

85
00:09:06,830 --> 00:09:09,230
It doesn’t matter if you have any unfulfilled wishes.

86
00:09:09,230 --> 00:09:10,950
Just a bit like my mother

87
00:09:10,950 --> 00:09:12,630
Oh, it turns out I miss my mother. Then you should take a rest first.

88
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:31,580
Let's go back first. Bye.

89
00:09:31,580 --> 00:09:34,480
Son, prepare to wash hands and eat

90
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:38,340
What's wrong, son?

91
00:09:38,340 --> 00:09:39,540
Mom, I miss you so much

92
00:09:39,540 --> 00:09:40,860
Silly son, what are you saying?

93
00:09:40,860 --> 00:09:41,860
Mom is always here

94
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:43,340
Liangliang, wash your hands and eat quickly

95
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:46,560
call me what

96
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,520
Eat quickly

97
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:49,770
you are not my mother

98
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:51,250
She never calls me Liangliang

99
00:09:51,250 --> 00:09:52,530
She only tells me to brighten
